},"id","qloeln1fz7m1p13bqgepbycjo","AWS宣布在Bedrock AgentCore中推出Web Answer工具，可让智能体快速生成带引用的实时答案。该工具整合搜索、验证、合成和引用流程，支持自定义域过滤、日期范围和地区本地化，与Web Search工具形成互补（前者提供完整答案，后者返回原始搜索结果）。","source",{"_49":191,"_192":190},"publishedAt","selected",true,"AWS Machine Learning Blog","firstParty",{"_183":184,"_11":28,"_25":185,"_186":194,"_188":19,"_189":190},{"_49":191,"_192":190},{"_196":197,"_11":198,"_18":19,"_15":16,"_199":200},"factId","fPpli8-MQ7b0","Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一般可用性","representative",{"_183":184,"_11":28,"_25":185,"_186":201,"_188":19,"_189":190},{"_49":191,"_192":190},"participants48h",0,"newParticipants6h","recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_209":210,"_211":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
